{
  "version": "0.6.4",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T11:12:00+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Removes the separate Minion Setup Optimizer ranking, its budget/slot controls, and the Horizon control so the Minion Calculator has one settings-driven ranking.",
    "Shows each minion's two selected best-upgrade slots directly in the main table; clicking a row still opens every compatible upgrade alternative.",
    "Adds data freshness and measured reliable-history depth to both the Bazaar Scanner and Minion Calculator. Reliable history requires at least 80% 7-day coverage.",
    "Adds per-minion historical data coverage warnings below 80% and shows the net-profit gap to the next-best minion.",
    "Renames Collect every to Collection interval; daily profit remains the main comparison while collection interval still controls compaction behavior.",
    "Carries the v0.6.3 automatic upgrade optimizer and Gravel/Flint Shovel correction."
  ],
